  "body": "The [payment request](https://www.w3.org/TR/payment-request/) spec [references](https://github.com/w3c/payment-request/blob/78aac89ce79e386b181d51b0538dd4085574d435/index.html#L1094-L1097) the HTML spec's [language definition](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#language).\r\n\r\nI'd like to export this definition with `data-export=\"\"` to allow the payment request spec to link to the definition and will raise a PR to do so.\r\n\r\nThank you.\r\n\r\ncc @marcoscaceres ",
